gametitle=Maxim - Instant Messenger (USA) (Unl)

[Bypass MAC address check (Fast boot)]
description=Forces the MAC address checksum verification to pass during MaxIM startup (with fast boot enabled).
author=Kuruyia
patch=1,IOP,000A0FAC,word,00000000

