patch=1,IOP,000A56AC,word,00000000

[Bypass MAC address check (No fast boot - BIOS 0160a 20020207)]
description=Forces the MAC address checksum verification to pass during MaxIM startup (with fast boot disabled, BIOS USA v01.60 07/02/2002).
